<title>USA: DuPont official to retire.</title>
<headline>DuPont official to retire.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Co said on Friday that Michael Emery will retire as senior vice president of operations on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>His position will not be filled and his responsibitities will be assumed by other DuPont managers, the company said.</p>
<p>Emery, who has been with the company 35 years, served in varying roles in the company, including manufacturing, engineering, information systems and materials procurement functions, DuPont said.</p>
<p>Emery is also responsible for DuPont's businesses in South America and Mexico, DuPont said.</p>
</text>
